  "description": "The Streamway is all about knocking down barriers. Its ultra-low step-through frame eliminates the traditional top tube, creating a wide-open design that makes getting on and off exceptionally easy. With a comfortable, upright riding position and easygoing design, the Streamway is ready for trips to the market, coffee shop, or a relaxing ride along your neighborhood bike path.\nLightweight 6061 aluminum frame for easy handling and everyday durability\nUltra-low 8\" step-through makes getting on and off exceptionally easy\nComfort cruiser saddle with elastomer suspension for a smooth, cushioned ride\nClassic city handlebar with adjustable-angle stem for a comfortable, customizable upright riding position\nErgonomic grips provide added hand comfort and support\nShimano Tourney 7-speed drivetrain with easy-to-use twist shifter\nTektro alloy linear-pull brakes for confident stopping\nLightweight alloy wheels with stainless steel spokes for strength and durability\n26 x 2.25\" Kenda tires for a smooth, comfortable ride\nFull-coverage fenders and chainguard help keep you clean and protected\nDurable center-mount kickstand for stable, convenient parking",
